<title>GERMANY: Hesse Oct CPI unch mo/mo, up 1.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hesse Oct CPI unch mo/mo, up 1.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state statistics</p>
<p>office in the German state of Hesse reported the following</p>
<p>consumer price changes for October.</p>
<p>    Cost of living		October	     September</p>
<p>    Month/month (pct change)  unch		  -0.1</p>
<p>    Year/year		     +1.3		  +1.2</p>
<p>NOTE - This data is later combined with data from three other major German states to calculate the preliminary figure for the whole of west Germany.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
